# Testing

- Pest for Feature and Unit tests
- Feature HTTP tests cover success, validation failure, and not-found where relevant
- Use RefreshDatabase; prefer PostgreSQL (Compose/CI), not external SaaS
- After substantive changes run: `vendor/bin/pint --test`, `vendor/bin/phpstan analyse`, `php artisan test`
- Report actual command output; never claim green without execution
